ntID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"table\",\"name\":\"events\",\"innerType\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns an unsorted list of event IDs present in the timeline.\",\"name\":\"GetEventList\",\"arguments\":[]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventState\",\"name\":\"state\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns the current state of a timeline event.\",\"name\":\"GetEventState\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"Seconds\",\"name\":\"timeElapsed\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns the elapsed duration of a timeline event.\",\"name\":\"GetEventTimeElapsed\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"Seconds\",\"name\":\"timeRemaining\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns the remaining duration of a timeline event.\",\"name\":\"GetEventTimeRemaining\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"LuaDurationObject\",\"name\":\"duration\",\"nilable\":true}],\"documentation\":\"Returns a Duration object that tracks the elapsed duration of a timeline event. This object tracks the range [0, duration] of the event and automatically pauses its progression based on event state.\",\"name\":\"GetEventTimer\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineTrack\",\"name\":\"track\",\"nilable\":false},{\"type\":\"luaIndex\",\"name\":\"trackSortIndex\",\"nilable\":true}],\"documentation\":\"Returns information about the position of an event on the timeline.\",\"name\":\"GetEventTrack\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"table\",\"name\":\"events\",\"innerType\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns a sorted list of event IDs present in the timeline from shortest to longest remaining durations, meeting the requirements of the specified filters.\",\"name\":\"GetSortedEventList\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"number\",\"name\":\"maxEventCount\",\"documentation\":\"Maximum number of sorted events to return.\",\"nilable\":true},{\"type\":\"Seconds\",\"name\":\"maxEventDuration\",\"documentation\":\"Maximum duration of sorted events to return.\",\"nilable\":true},{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"excludeTerminalStates\",\"default\":true,\"documentation\":\"If false, include events that are terminal states such as Canceled or Finished.\",\"nilable\":false},{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"excludeHiddenEvents\",\"default\":true,\"documentation\":\"If false, include events that should be hidden by user configuration, such as events on long tracks when the user has opted to not show long countdowns.\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineTrackInfo\",\"name\":\"trackInfo\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns information for a single timeline track.\",\"name\":\"GetTrackInfo\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineTrack\",\"name\":\"track\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"table\",\"name\":\"tracks\",\"innerType\":\"EncounterTimelineTrackInfo\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns information about all timeline tracks.\",\"name\":\"GetTrackList\",\"arguments\":[]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"Seconds\",\"name\":\"maxEventDuration\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns the maximum permitted event duration on a single timeline track.\",\"name\":\"GetTrackMaxEventDuration\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineTrack\",\"name\":\"track\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineTrackType\",\"name\":\"trackType\",\"nilable\":false}],\"documentation\":\"Returns the type of a single t