unction will always return false if the feature is not available.\",\"name\":\"IsFeatureEnabled\",\"arguments\":[]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Pauses a custom timeline event, hiding it from the timeline. A paused event can later be resumed to show it again, or canceled.\",\"name\":\"PauseScriptEvent\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Resumes a custom timeline event, showing it on the timeline again if it is currently paused.\",\"name\":\"ResumeScriptEvent\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Updates a given vector of texture objects to reference art assets for icons associated with an event.\",\"name\":\"SetEventIconTextures\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineEventID\",\"name\":\"eventID\",\"nilable\":false},{\"type\":\"EncounterEventIconmask\",\"name\":\"includeIcons\",\"documentation\":\"Mask to apply to candidate icons. Any icon bits not present in this set will not be assigned to textures.\",\"nilable\":false},{\"type\":\"table\",\"name\":\"textures\",\"documentation\":\"Array of texture objects to update. This will change the assigned atlases and alpha values of the region, applying secret aspects to protect the data.\",\"innerType\":\"SimpleTexture\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Changes the view type for the timeline. This adjusts track layouts to be more appropriate for a specific mode and optimizes event processing.\",\"name\":\"SetViewType\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"EncounterTimelineViewType\",\"name\":\"viewType\",\"nilable\":false}]}],\"tables\":[{\"fields\":[{\"type\":\"number\",\"name\":\"maxEventCount\",\"documentation\":\"Maximum number of sorted events to return.\",\"nilable\":true},{\"type\":\"Seconds\",\"name\":\"maxEventDuration\",\"documentation\":\"Maximum duration of sorted events to return.\",\"nilable