ors, so having only this toggled on may still include decor that can also be placed indoors\",\"name\":\"SetAllowedOutdoors\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"isActive\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"If true, searcher automatically updates results whenever search param values are changed\",\"name\":\"SetAutoUpdateOnParamChanges\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"autoUpdateActive\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Search parameter; If true, only the base variant of each decor entry will be included\",\"name\":\"SetBaseVariantOnly\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"isActive\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Search parameter; If true, includes all owned entries, including those that are in storage OR placed in an owned house or plot; See IsStoredOnlyActive for a more exclusive toggle\",\"name\":\"SetCollected\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"isActive\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Search parameter; If true, catalog entries that cannot be customized (ie dyed) will be excluded from the search\",\"name\":\"SetCustomizableOnly\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"isActive\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Search parameter; If set, limits search results to only entries that are used/valid in the specified editor mode\",\"name\":\"SetEditorModeContext\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"HouseEditorMode\",\"name\":\"editorModeContext\",\"nilable\":true}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Set the toggle state of a single filter tag within a specific group\",\"name\":\"SetFilterTagStatus\",\"arguments\":[{\"type\":\"number\",\"name\":\"groupID\",\"nilable\":false},{\"type\":\"number\",\"name\":\"tagID\",\"nilable\":false},{\"type\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"active\",\"nilable\":false}]},{\"returns\":[],\"documentation\":\"Search parameter; If set, limits search results to only those within the specifie